Hello,

Is it possible to make a 'AUTOMATIC NEWS LEVEL EXTRACTER'?

Some people complain that there exist no programmed levels. The problem
with programmed levels is that if you know them there is no fun any more.
It would be nice if the developmentteam could post a new level and the
game automatically installs the level (so the level is also a suprise for
the nethackadministrator).

I think there are only two problems.

1. The different newssystems. I do not know if this can be solved.

2. Security. Not authorisized people should not be allowed to post a level.
   This can be solved with a new moderated newsgroup rec.games.hack.levels
   (I don't know this is save) or with a complex encode en decode system
   (with large prime numbers etc.).

Any comments?

